  "body": "Firefox has a long list of CSS properties that get reset for rendering text inputs, [for example](https://dxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/rev/21bf1af375c1fa8565ae3bb2e89bd1a0809363d4/layout/style/res/forms.css#91). Servo is slowly gaining them as we come across cases where parent styles bleed into the internal styles of the widgets. Do these properties belong in the specification in sections like [\"the input element as a text entry widget\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#the-input-element-as-a-text-entry-widget)?\n",
